+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// FONT VECTOR baking (pocket-motion)
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// The atlas stores its cell height, baseline, line height, advances and kern
+// deltas in bytes, so a cell over 255 px cannot be written down at all. A
+// vector slot writes the SAME quantities, by the same formulas, in wider
+// fields — so at a size both can bake, a string lays out identically either
+// way — and replaces coverage cells with the glyphs' outlines, which the core
+// fills as PATH ops (patches/0042) at whatever size and under whatever
+// transform the node ends up drawn.
